error[E0069]: the constants `width` and `height` refer to each other in a cycle
 --> tests/ui/04-declarations/constants/cycle.cheby:5:11
  |
5 | pub const width: Int = height * 2
  |           ^^^^^        ------ `width` uses `height` here
6 |
7 | pub const height: Int = width / 2
  |                         ----- `height` uses `width` here
  |
  = note: a constant is evaluated from the constants it uses, at compile time, so a cycle has no value
  = help: give one of them a value that does not depend on the others

